1. sudo cp -r ~/.kube /var/lib/jenkins/ 
2. sudo chown -R jenkins:jenkins /var/lib/jenkins/.kube
3. create a deploy to k8s stage 
4. create a parameter to choose one of three
  deploy on using docker, deploy only to k8s, deploy to docker and k8s 
5. use when directive 
6. if docker and k8s ( deployment to both should be parallel)
